OL,3,APolice believed train attacker had
OL,4,Aschizophrenia, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridge Crown Court heard PC Caitlin
OL,7,FBrown, who was involved in transporting
OL,8,FWilliams to hospital then to the police
OL,9,Fstation, said he "appeared to be
OL,10,Ftalking to himself" and spoke about the
OL,11,Fdevil.
OL,13,FWilliams, 33, of Langford Road in
OL,14,FPeterborough, also denies four other
OL,15,Fcounts of attempted murder related to
OL,16,Fearlier attacks in Peterborough and
OL,17,FLondon.
